  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Abongoua Rice Production Capacity Building</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Grant funds will be used to purchase rice paddy from cooperative members, which COPRORIZ will process and resell. Funds will also be used to increase warehousing capacity, allowing COPRORIZ to purchase more paddy from its members and store it in adequate conditions that maintain the rice&apos;s quality.</narrative>
  </description>
